m.pick' 5
is! 'pick(a, b) := b
pick(a) := a
m = {pick: 1, other: 2}
m.pick = 5
m.other' 2
is! 'pick(a, b) := b
pick(a) := a
m = {pick: 1}
m.pick' 1

